form duration-300 hover:scale-105" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F251%2Fhoi2u4hf24f9h2hfg23yiqdqdi22d3%2FgarminWatch.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F251%2Fhoi2u4hf24f9h2hfg23yiqdqdi22d3%2FgarminWatch.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F251%2Fhoi2u4hf24f9h2hfg23yiqdqdi22d3%2FgarminWatch.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75"/></div><div style="width:150px;height:150px" class="jsx-151520615 bg-jtb-black flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg p-2 shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"><img alt="Carousel image 15" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full rounded-lg object-cover transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F251%2Fh9824f2489h29348hf3424ui%2FappleWatch.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F251%2Fh9824f2489h29348hf3424ui%2FappleWatch.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F251%2Fh9824f2489h29348hf3424ui%2FappleWatch.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75"/></div><div style="width:150px;height:150px" class="jsx-151520615 bg-jtb-black flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg p-2 shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-lg"><img alt="Carousel image 16" loading="lazy" width="150" height="150" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full rounded-lg object-cover transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F252%2Fioeahfjoiehfoi4f3%2F25.2_second.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F252%2Fioeahfjoiehfoi4f3%2F25.2_second.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fintvl-images.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fterra-comps%2F252%2Fioeahfjoiehfoi4f3%2F25.2_second.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div style="height:500px"></div><section id="faq" class="relative flex flex-col justify-center pb-12 pt-20" style="z-index:30"><h1 class="text-h2 lg:text-h1 text-jtb-dark-peach px-4 text-center font-bold lg:px-0">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h1><div class="faqs"><div class="faq "><div class="faq-question font-sohne text-jtb-white text-paragraph">How much does INTVL cost?</div><div class="faq-answer font-sohne text-jtb-grey text-paragraph">INTVL is free to play, no subscription needed. However, we do offer a premium subscription that unlocks additional features and personalised training plans to help you reach your fitness goals.</div></div><div class="faq "><div class="faq-question font-sohne text-jtb-white text-paragraph">I don&#x27;t know if I even like running, should I try INTVL?</div><div class="faq-answer font-sohne text-jtb-grey text-paragraph">Yes. INTVL redefines running by making it fun and engaging through gamification. You&#x27;ll be exploring new areas and competing with friends and capturing new places in your city. It&#x27;s a great way to discover if running is for you.</div></div><div class="faq "><div class="faq-question font-sohne text-jtb-white text-paragraph">Can I sync INTVL with Strava ?</div><div class="faq-answer font-sohne text-jtb-grey text-paragraph">Yes. You have the option to also upload your run to Strava from the INTVL app whenever you complete a run.</div></div><div class="faq "><div class="faq-question font-sohne text-jtb-white text-paragraph">Is there smart-watch support ?</div><div class="faq-answer font-sohne text-jtb-grey text-paragraph">Yes. We currently have integrations for Apple, Garmin, Suunto, Polar and Coros watches.</div></div><div class="faq "><div class="faq-question font-sohne text-jtb-white text-paragraph">I don&#x27;t know how to run</div><div class="faq-answer font-sohne text-jtb-grey text-paragraph">No problem at all. INTVL has a range of personalised training plans built by our professional coach Josh Balia who has a double bachelors in Psychology and Exercise Science. These plans will help you learn how to run and build up your fitness level in a safe and progressive way.</div></div><div class="faq "><div class="faq-question font-sohne text-jtb-white text-paragraph">Is there someone to help answer my questions on my running journey?</div><div class="faq-answer font-sohne text-jtb-grey text-paragraph">Yes. In the INTVL app there is an extensive FAQ section as well as the option to ask your own question and our team will answer it.</div></div></div></section><section id="home" class="bg-off-black flex flex-col pb-20 pt-2"><div class="pt-8"></div><button class="z-10 mx-auto" tabindex="0"><div class="bg-jtb-dark-peach z-10 w-56 px-3 py-6 text-center duration-200 hover:scale-110" style="border-radius:4px"><a href="/download-app"><h1 class="text-h4 text-jtb-black font-bold">Download INTVL</h1></a></div></button><div class="mt-8 flex w-full items-center justify-center"><a class="text-jtb-white text-sm underline" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></div></section></main></main></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{}},"page":"/","query":{},"buildId":"fxSDZG3m7KVANSwFMqPuX","nextExport":true,"autoExport":true,"isFallback":false,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>